    fix(build): declare setuptools+wheel in the `dev` extra so a clean venv can gate
    
    tests/test_packaging_wheel.py builds a wheel with `pip wheel --no-build-isolation`
    and asserts `pip`/`setuptools` are importable, but the `dev` extra declared only
    pytest/pyyaml/lxml. A fresh `pip install -e '.[dev]'` therefore produced
    2 ERRORS in the QA gate on files this doc work never touched, which is what kept
    the AUG-151 worker from committing.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
